rd of 23' overhead utility clearance is required at all intersections.  Utility investigation consists of Level D - utility mapping with on-site field verification of visible utility features (manholes, valves, junction boxes, etc)  to more accurately show underground line locations.  \n\nDESIGNER NOTE - upgrade signal and add Type III westbound\n\n\n2) WHERE TO FIND MORE INFORMATION (CONCEPT, ETC):  Please refer to Scope of Work for signal #6399.  Pelase contact Adam Lough or Carrie O'Neill for additional information.\n\n3) RECOMMENDED TYPE DELIVERY AND CONSTRUCTION METHOD:  Procurement\n\n\n4) PROJECT SPECIFIC COMMENTS AND EXPECTATIONS:  State, $100K SIGNALS M&O  FY25\n\nDesign - $20K  \nROW - to be added later, if needed\nUtilities (Power) - $10K\nConstruction - $50K\nSF Materials -$20K \nThese are ballpark estimates, but should be a general guide on expected costs from the Program Manager.  If estimates are off, approval is needed from Adam Lough.\n\n\n5) FUNDING NOTES:  SIGNALS M&O $100,000 FY25\n\n","project_type":"SAFETY","project_value":117159,"projected_start_date":null,"pub_ctc_email":null,"pub_ctc_nm":null,"pub_ctc_ph":null,"public_desc":"The upgrade of existing traffic signals may include new signals due to wear and tear, roadway widening, additional or new detection systems and updated standards.","public_desc_tag1":null,"public_desc_tag2":null,"public_desc_tag3":null,"public_desc_tag4":null,"public_desc_tag5":null,"re_cons_contact_email":null,"re_cons_contact_nm":null,"re_cons_contact_phone":null,"region_cd":"3","region_prty":300,"road_sys_cd":"U","route_class":"STATE","route_desc":"RT 0052P - 800  N - CANYON Parkway  - HIGHWAY 52 - Orem - UTAH COUNTY","route_dir_id":"313","route_id":"0052PM","rr_crossings_included":"N","scoping_status_dt":"2025-01-14T00:00:00+00:00","secondary_concept":" ","sep_mstr_yn_typ":null,"sponsor_name":"UTAH DEPT. OF TRANSPORTATION","st_fed_ind":"S","start_dat":null,"state_dollars":117159,"stimulus_flag":null,"stip_sponsor_cd"